          "content": "A\n\nChoosing greater overall prosperity maximizes the expected quality of life and aggregate well-being for the population as a whole. Because people at almost every level enjoy a higher standard of living, the total sum of happiness and flourishing is significantly higher, offering the greatest overall benefit across the widest range of possible outcomes.",
